# Frontend UI

- Use shadcn/ui with custom design tokens — not the default theme
- 4px spacing grid, 13–14px body text, 2–4px border radius
- No gradient heroes, no rounded-2xl cards, no decorative shadows
- Density over whitespace — operational cockpit, not marketing page
- Match existing patterns in `frontend/components/` when that directory exists
